1. Developing and implementing a National Cybersecurity Strategy that will ensure the protection of critical infrastructure, personal information, and financial systems.
2. Implementing new cybersecurity standards and guidelines for businesses and organizations to ensure they are compliant with best practices.
3. Providing training and education to individuals and organizations on cybersecurity best practices, including awareness campaigns and cybersecurity awareness training programs.
