6. Encouraging collaboration between industry, academia, and government to develop new technologies and solutions to address cybersecurity challenges.
7. Providing support for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) to develop and implement cybersecurity measures.
8. Implementing a national cybersecurity framework to ensure that all levels of government and organizations are working together to address cybersecurity challenges.
