 5 of 35  •  NATiONAL CYBER SECURiTY STRATEGYImplementing the Strategy
Recognizing that the pace of change we see today will only accelerate, this 
Strategy is designed as the mainstay of the Government’s continuous efforts to enhance cyber security in Canada. The Government’s actions will evolve alongside the ground-breaking technological developments and resulting paradigm shifts that have become common in our connected world.
Cyber security action plans will supplement this Strategy. These will detail 
the specific initiatives that the federal government will undertake over time, with clear performance metrics and a commitment to report on results achieved. They will also outline the Government’s plan for working with internal and external partners to achieve its vision. 
